[[File:Rosewick Plantation.png|thumb|right|300px]]
The '''Rosewick Plantation''' is an abandoned farmland south of the [[Greymane Wall]] in [[Gilneas]]. The Rosewicks, [[Donald Rosewick|Donald]] and his wife [[Frell Rosewick|Frell]], have been displaced by the arrival of the worgen and evacuated to find safety at the [[Shademore Tavern]]. The farmland is currently overrun by worgen of the Nighthowl pack that entered Gilneas through [[Oldrock Pass]].

